<title>UK: Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Lufthansa.</title>
<headline>Morgan Stanley sets warrants on Lufthansa.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Wertpapiere GmbH has issued a total of two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on shares of Deutsche Lufthansa AG, lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank AG said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   17.SEP.98		 PAYDATE	22.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FRANKFURT		 MIN EXER LOT 1,000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  35 DEM</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT     STRIKE	ISSUE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	35 DEM	5.55 DEM   15.85 PCT    6.3 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	40 DEM	3.70 DEM   24.85 PCT    9.5 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
